+// parquet-go/5: reading a file into a Go struct with a [N]byte field the
+// file has no column for (the ordinary schema-evolution case, which
+// parquet-go otherwise handles by filling the column with nulls) panics
+// with "reflect.Set: value of type []uint8 is not assignable to type
